# Benchmark artifact retention policy

This repository keeps benchmark evidence under `research-data/results/`.

- Validated JSONL result files generated by `benchmarks/bench_scenarios.py` are retained here.
- Raw benchmark output should not be deleted when it supports a recorded performance claim.
- Temporary scratch files and debug outputs are ignored by git.

Example file names:

- `research-data/results/bounded-benchmark.jsonl`
- `research-data/results/benchmark-2026-11-17.jsonl`
